<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PECO Energy cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PECO Energy cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it downgraded PECO Energy Co to intermediate reduce from intermediate neutral.</p>
<p>-- PECO lost one to 23 in morning trading.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
